MID_MV00_04: <SH>
MID_MV00_04_m001: I'm seeing a breach that's\ncoming from the south wall.
MID_MV00_04_m002: Hostiles are invading. It's a massive force.
MID_MV00_04_m003: They're headed straight for Kunlun!
MID_MV00_04_m004: They cannot reach the village.
MID_MV00_04_m005: Then I'll stop them.
MID_MV00_04_m006: (roar)
MID_MV00_04_m007: (shout)
MID_MV00_04_m008: Beginning defensive countermeasures.
MID_MV00_04_m009: (panicked exert)
MID_MV00_04_m010: (roar)
MID_MV00_04_m011: (surprised exert)
MID_MV00_04_m012: (annoyed exert)
MID_MV00_04_m013: I would never have thought they would\nsend their forces all the way out here.
MID_MV00_04_m014: What drew their attention?
MID_MV00_04_m015: We were so close to finishing...
MID_MV00_04_m016: (thinking)
MID_MV00_04_m017: (notice something)
MID_MV00_04_m018: The defensive line for Kunlun has been\ncompletely overrun.
MID_MV00_04_m019: Their target will be us.
MID_MV00_04_m020: (alerted exert)
MID_MV00_04_m021: (surprised exert, stumbling a bit)
MID_MV00_04_m032: (realize)
MID_MV00_04_m033: Hong Hua!
MID_MV00_04_m034: Yes?
MID_MV00_04_m035: Are you able to hold a line out there?\nAll I require is time to work.
MID_MV00_04_m036: You'll have it.
MID_MV00_04_m037: Hong Hua...don't die out there.
MID_MV00_04_m038: I will not. No need to worry.
MID_MV00_04_m039: Focus on distraction only. I can\nhandle the rest of it in here.
MID_MV00_04_m040: (breath)